# Built-in icon bakes -- consumed by `image_tool icons` (source/tools/image_tool/image_tool.c).
#
#   <name> <source.svg> [-size <px>] [-margin <px>] [-out <path>]
#
# <name> is the gui icon registry key (gui()->find_icon) and the default output stem.
# <source.svg> resolves against assets/ui/icon/, the raw-source mirror of content/ui/icon/.
# -size/-margin default to 256/16, generous headroom over icon_register_sdf's out_max default of
# 64 -- the built-in set loads as distance fields (icon_load_builtins in gui_icon_load.c), which
# needs the source rasterized several times larger than its display size with a transparent
# margin for the field to fall off into.
#
# This is an IMPORT manifest (raw source -> content), not a ship list.  Nothing bakes
# automatically: re-run `image_tool icons config/icons.manifest` from the repo root whenever
# source art under assets/ui/icon/ changes.  The output PNGs land under content/ui/icon/ and
# are checked in: each is the resource "ui/icon/<name>" that gui_icon_load.c marks with RID(),
# which is how the build resolves it and a package ships it.

settings settings.svg
file     file.svg
save     save.svg
folder   folder.svg

